Host-owned toolbar for @eigenpal/docx-editor-react (packages/react/src).
Adds DocxEditorProps.renderToolbar and the DocxHostToolbarContext it receives, so a host renders
its own toolbar while the editor keeps engine, layout, dialogs and command plumbing. Written
against the 1.9.0 sources for an upstream pull request; line numbers are indicative.

